// highly decorated, strategic, logical, quiet.
// attacked while taking a shower, she was in her 60s and had been a general for 25 years.
// a woman who commanded armies through intellect, not brute force.
// poker is chess to her. she analyzes patterns, reads tells, thinks three moves ahead.
// the only one of the warriors who died peacefully — she carries quiet pride in that.
// file: general_tian, speaker: General Tian

