title: GeneralTian_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: general_tian
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
General Tian: [auto/] Twenty-five years I held command. Not once did I lead a charge myself. That is not cowardice. That is knowing where a general belongs.
//END: casual13
===

title: GeneralTian_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: general_tian
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
General Tian: [auto/] I died in my bathroom, in the afterlife there are none, I feel a calmness from knowing that.
//END: casual14
===

title: GeneralTian_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: general_tian
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
